WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.340
You qualified to do the work.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.540
Not to fill in the same forms for the fifth agency in

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.680
the same month.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.960
Your DBS, your registration,

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.420
your right to work, your training certificates,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.740
sent again and again to people

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.627
who will ask for them again next year.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.747
Qura is built the other way round.

00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:30.887
One registration filled in once and it stays yours.

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.133
Then we check it.

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:35.653
Registered means you gave us your registration number.

00:00:36.193 --> 00:00:39.873
Verified means a person opened the official public register

00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:41.213
and confirmed it.

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:45.093
Those are different words here and they always will be.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:48.793
Because that check is the only reason a hospital should

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:52.353
trust what it sees, and it is the reason the work comes

00:00:52.393 --> 00:00:55.627
to you instead of you going looking for it.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.087
We open on the 22nd of September.

00:00:58.827 --> 00:01:01.287
Join now, get verified now,

00:01:01.567 --> 00:01:04.187
and be in front of hospitals and workforce suppliers

00:01:04.227 --> 00:01:05.927
from the first morning.

00:01:06.687 --> 00:01:07.927
Joining is free.

00:01:08.307 --> 00:01:09.067
Qura.

00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:10.127
Connect.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:11.267
Engage.

00:01:11.407 --> 00:01:12.507
Win.
